  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "最多三人进入逐步升级的异常区，在继续深入争取战利品与及时撤离之间押注。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Deploy alone or with up to two friends and take the fight into unstable mythic combat zones where every mission is another chance to bring something dangerous back alive — or make sure it never returns.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2282790/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "任务中的Lythogram升级可重塑流派，叠加修正并触发协同。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Wield experimental weapons, manipulate rift energy, and harness in-mission Lythogram upgrades to reshape your builds and playstyles mid-mission. Stack modifiers. Trigger synergies.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2282790/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "撤离失败不仅丢失任务所得，带入武器还会随机替换一项模组为负面疤痕。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "If you fail to extract, not only will you lose everything you’ve found on mission, and the weapons you brought will not come back unscathed. Scarred Weapons will replace one of its weapon mods with a random negative mod.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2282790/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
